# Items test (issue #64): run east down the itemstest corridor over 20
# pickups, one per tile. Start: 100 health, 0 armour, 50 charges.
# Linen Wrap -> armour 100, Bandage Scrap -> 102, Scarab Plate -> 200,
# Golden Sardine -> health 200; ammo, Litter Satchel, Scattergun, three
# keys, Catnip, Cat's Eye, Ninth Life (PICKUP_TRIGGER tag 3).
# The skill-3 Scarab Plate in the alcove does not spawn at skill 2.
vsdemo 1
level 1
skill 2
seed 0
map itemstest
wait 5
in 130 127 0 0 R
wait 10
# Final STATS: health=200 armor=200 items=20/20.
expect health=200
expect armor=200
expect items=20
